                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Old-school FPS from 2017 where, as the sole surviving soldier, you fight your way through trap-filled facilities against cyborgs and mutants\n\n✅Good soundtrack\n✅The game evokes brutal, retro-style shooters\n✅Interesting secrets and level elements, such as destructible objects\n\n❌Lack of proper explanation for mechanics and controls\n❌Awkward controls for crouching, aiming, and shooting\n❌No settings options,cannot adjust volume or resolution\n❌Only one difficulty level\n❌Enemies deal massive damage\n❌Level design is unclear at times, with no guidance on where to go\n❌The price is too high\n\n❌❌ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [b] Bad [/b], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [strike] Good [/strike], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for the game tested)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand in my group: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask. I'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!! Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
